{"version":1,"content":"<p>MIRROR成員盧瀚霆（教主，AL）日前到峇里出席邱士縉和李炘頤婚禮，今晚（29日）教主在社交平台派福利，他分享兩張「背多Fun」照片，展示背肌和線條以及結實肩膊，並以英文留言：\"It's not about being perfect; it's about putting in the effort.（重點不在於追求完美，而在於付出努力。</p><p>）\"連人夫邱士縉也搞笑留言：「要逼死誰？</p><p>」</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T14:22:02.487178+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":195,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T13:58:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T06:19:38.392112+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T14:18:24.542841+00:00","content_hash":"1c0feb293be5e4fefdd899e052a25b020fe30a7aad3dee41f9a02e360b0f8a7e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}